    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>本期为第5期⎨电影节⎬漫谈节目，我们来谈蜂鸟所参与的于4月1日至12日举办的第50届香港国际电影节展映的部分电影，以及她此行在香港院线观看的部分影片。</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>本期主播</span></strong><span>：蜂鸟 Aki</span></p><p><strong><span>音频剪辑</span></strong><span>：西红是番茄</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsP_7Zm_R8AuV3Hz5YezrL_fdoBw.jpg"></figure><p><span>✨镜面计划是一档由独立影迷共同创作的电影评论播客。我们试图用拆解一部电影的过程来重构与它的连接。</span></p><p><span>✨</span><strong><span>镜面计划会坚持鼓励所有真实的表达，用观点激发观点，也欢迎一切讨论和批评。</span></strong></p><p><span>✨</span><em><span>欢迎关注同名微信公众号及豆瓣账号。</span></em></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlxIYIalVqWnBmACXRSlbTa__KW_.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>~<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="22">00:22</a>：</span><strong><span>导语</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="22">00:22</a>~<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="324">05:24</a>：</span><strong><span>音乐欣赏</span></strong></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkb7f3n2RR0cErptYTZSrqAdhPQz.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="324">05:24</a>~<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="561">09:21</a>：</span><strong><span>《大濛》</span></strong></p><p><em><span>·&nbsp;类型选择，演员表演与影片调性、质感令人失望</span></em></p><p><em><span>·&nbsp;影片落点的收窄</span></em></p><p><em><span>·&nbsp;与本土当下情绪的温和背反</span></em></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoZRbNmxcwCrLATq0YZS44xS9AF-.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="561">09:21</a>~<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="729">12:09</a>：</span><strong><span>《袒露》</span></strong></p><p><em><span>·&nbsp;主题重心选择差强人意</span></em></p><p><em><span>·&nbsp;核心表达与呈现效果的相悖</span></em></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvXT4eQJkbc6UxjZR8Sb3wP1f5Mx.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="729">12:09</a>~<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="798">13:18</a>：</span><strong><span>《国家公诉人》</span></strong></p><p><em><span>·&nbsp;记录式剧情片</span></em></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv0Qs3UfX7AQ8mqhdwlKcG6pv4Fk.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="798">13:18</a>~<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="970">16:10</a>：</span><strong><span>《女孩不平凡》</span></strong></p><p><em><span>·&nbsp;人生三阶段的情感状态接力</span></em></p><p><em><span>·&nbsp;非“真爱无敌”的he结局</span></em></p><p><em><span>·&nbsp;“两岸三地”的多地恋线索</span></em></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjjQnhBzVVLmJkzjw14I82jEAu56.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="970">16:10</a>~<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1085">18:05</a>：</span><strong><span>《龟之凝视，窥探星辰》</span></strong></p><p><em><span>·&nbsp;困惑.jpg</span></em></p><p><em><span>·&nbsp;疫情题材、科幻概念、身体认同与自然主义的结合</span></em></p><p><em><span>·&nbsp;封控元素铺设</span></em></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpHpbbWAJkil4sgewgr3x27Dyz1H.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1085">18:05</a>~<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1468">24:28</a>：</span><strong><span>《弗兰茨》</span></strong></p><p><em><span>·&nbsp;同人文式传记片的独特趣味</span></em></p><p><em><span>·&nbsp;解构即凝视</span></em></p><p><em><span>·&nbsp;核心情节的陈旧</span></em></p><p><em><span>·&nbsp;恶趣味场面的娱乐精神</span></em></p><p><em><span>·&nbsp;《利益区域》视角的有利有弊</span></em></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrRzbz5-HUQiTfPWKA18181clzkm.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1468">24:28</a>~<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2248">37:28</a>：</span><strong><span>《万事顺利》</span></strong></p><p><em><span>·&nbsp;高概念和气质在东亚青春片中的稀缺性</span></em></p><p><em><span>·&nbsp;中二的自洽性</span></em></p><p><em><span>·&nbsp;演员选择、迷影梗、说唱元素的成功</span></em></p><p><em><span>·&nbsp;童话、卡通感与cult气质的微妙结合</span></em></p><p><em><span>·&nbsp;“烧仓房”</span></em></p><p><em><span>·&nbsp;两个时空回溯迷影梗拔高结尾表达</span></em></p><p><em><span>·&nbsp;青春期青涩的个人说唱cypher</span></em></p><p><em><span>·&nbsp;与《恶之地》“星期一小姐”的类比</span></em></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgH1WnOlcSeRmztDiCM4Hosa8Ljw.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2248">37:28</a>~<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2403">40:03</a>：</span><strong><span>关于香港电影节</span></strong></p><p><em><span>·&nbsp;注意事项</span></em></p><p><em><span>·&nbsp;观影感受</span></em></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs4qjgWShgq3z0KmDZyRLMbs7Q4i.jpg"></figure><p></p>]]></description>
